id: pan-long-drag
section: Scrolling and gestures
item: The GPU path: drag-scroll a long page with a fixed header (`jihad-long-static.html`) at a steady pace: the header stays put, the text is continuous, nothing blank enters from below; a tap after the scroll lands where it should (the header still and the content moved by the frame; the card's scroll and the engine's agree)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-long-static.html
kit: cavekit-gpu-rendering.md R3
calibrate 'sel:#content p'
expect zoom 1.0 0.01
expect url jihad-long-static
expect content 0,150,768,400 'sel:#content p' 'quick brown'
sample header header
sample content 0,300,756,900
drag 480 900 480 250
expect card-scroll 650 100
wait still header 4
expect region-equal header header
expect region-changed 0,300,756,900 content
expect top 'sel:#content p:nth-child(11)'
tap 'sel:#content p:nth-child(12)'
expect hit 'sel:#content p:nth-child(12)'
